# .gitignore for MERN Stack App

### General ###
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
*.bak
*.swp
*.pid
*.pid.lock

### Environment Files ###
# Backend environment files
Back-end/.env
Back-end/.env.*
!backend/.env.example  # Keep example files

# Frontend environment files (if using Create-React-App)
Front-end/.env
Front-end/.env.*
Front-end/.env.local
Front-end/.env.development.local
Front-end/.env.test.local
Front-end/.env.production.local
.env

### Dependencies ###
# Node modules - root, backend, and frontend
**/node_modules/
node_modules/

# Build files
**/build/
build/

# Dependency directories
jspm_packages/
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*

### Backend Specific ###
# Database files
*.db
*.sqlite

# Production files
backend/dist/
backend/public/uploads/

### Frontend Specific ###
# React
frontend/.next/
frontend/.cache/
frontend/out/
frontend/.sass-cache/

# Testing
/coverage
**/.nyc_output

### IDE ###
.vscode/
.idea/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

### OS Generated ###
ehthumbs.db
Icon?
Network Trash Folder
Temporary Items
.apdisk